research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/fs-q-is-g-delta.md-384-
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/fs-q-is-g-delta.md-385-The witness is the set $X := \mathbb{R} \setminus \mathbb{Q}_{\mathbb{R}}$ of
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/fs-q-is-g-delta.md-386-irrationals ([[lem-rat-embeds-dense]]). It **is** $G_\delta$, being
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/fs-q-is-g-delta.md-387-$\bigcap_n (\mathbb{R} \setminus \{e(n)\})$ for any enumeration $e$ of the
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/fs-q-is-g-delta.md-388-rationals, and it **is** residual, its complement being a countable union of
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/fs-q-is-g-delta.md-389-singletons; but it is **not** $F_\sigma$, and that is the failure of the refuted
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/fs-q-is-g-delta.md-390-claim. The refutation is carried out in full in
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/fs-q-is-g-delta.md:391:[[cor-q-is-meager-and-not-g-delta]]; this item records the witness and the three
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/fs-q-is-g-delta.md-392-properties that make it the right one.
