research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-refuter-fs-q-is-g-delta.prompt.md-680-  closed sets is closed. The definitions above are exactly what one gets by
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-refuter-fs-q-is-g-delta.prompt.md-681-  relaxing "finite" to "countable" once, and the point of the whole notion is
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-refuter-fs-q-is-g-delta.prompt.md-682-  that the relaxation is proper: a countable intersection of open sets need not
