research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.md-46-
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.md-47-The witness is the set $X := \mathbb{R} \setminus \mathbb{Q}_{\mathbb{R}}$ of
