research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.md-49-$\bigcap_n (\mathbb{R} \setminus \{e(n)\})$ for any enumeration $e$ of the
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.md-50-rationals, and it **is** residual, its complement being a countable union of
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.md-51-singletons; but it is **not** $F_\sigma$, and that is the failure of the refuted
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.md-52-claim. The refutation is carried out in full in
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.md:53:[[cor-q-is-meager-and-not-g-delta]]; this item records the witness and the three
