research/audit/wave8-dispatch/certifier-cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.prompt.md-192-
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/certifier-cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.prompt.md-193-The witness is the set $X := \mathbb{R} \setminus \mathbb{Q}_{\mathbb{R}}$ of
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/certifier-cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.prompt.md-194-irrationals ([[lem-rat-embeds-dense]]). It **is** $G_\delta$, being
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/certifier-cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.prompt.md-195-$\bigcap_n (\mathbb{R} \setminus \{e(n)\})$ for any enumeration $e$ of the
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/certifier-cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.prompt.md-196-rationals, and it **is** residual, its complement being a countable union of
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/certifier-cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.prompt.md-197-singletons; but it is **not** $F_\sigma$, and that is the failure of the refuted
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/certifier-cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.prompt.md-198-claim. The refutation is carried out in full in
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/certifier-cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.prompt.md:199:[[cor-q-is-meager-and-not-g-delta]]; this item records the witness and the three
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/certifier-cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma.prompt.md-200-properties that make it the right one.
