research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2526-  selections are two instantiations. Nothing on this page uses the countably
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2527-  infinite version, and every meager set met below is presented together with an
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2528-  explicit witnessing sequence.
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2529-
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2530-- **Nowhere dense is strictly stronger than having empty interior.**
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2531-  $\mathbb{Q}$ has empty interior, since no neighbourhood consists of rationals
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2532-  alone, yet $\overline{\mathbb{Q}} = \mathbb{R}$ has interior $\mathbb{R}$, so
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2533-  $\mathbb{Q}$ is not nowhere dense. It is nevertheless meager, being a union of
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md:2534:  singletons; that computation is [[cor-q-is-meager-and-not-g-delta]].
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2535-
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2536-- **First category, second category and residual are not a trichotomy.** A set
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2537-  is meager or of the second category, and those two are exhaustive and
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2538-  exclusive by definition. Residual is a separate condition on the complement: a
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2539-  residual set is of the second category once $\mathbb{R}$ is known not to be
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2540-  meager in itself ([[thm-baire-category-r]]), but before that theorem nothing
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2541-  rules out a set that is both meager and residual.
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/thm-cantor-set-properties.md-2542-
