research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-refuter-fs-measure-zero-implies-nowhere-dense.prompt.md-169-  the Smith-Volterra-Cantor set is nowhere dense and not null
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-refuter-fs-measure-zero-implies-nowhere-dense.prompt.md-170-  ([[fs-nowhere-dense-implies-measure-zero]]).
